    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"just being\" feels so heavy. it's like being a ghost in a world that's already full. if my life is just this empty loop and it doesn't change anything for anyone, doesn't it feel kind of logical that it should just end? like, if there's no impact, there's no reason to keep the struggle going.",
